<div class="page-content">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">

    <div class="content-section">
      <p>The purpose of the <strong>Cooperation with the Professional Community Committee</strong> is to provide accurate information about AA to those who have contact with alcoholics through their profession, as well as those working in the field of alcoholism.</p>

      <h3>Committees focus on:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Establishing better communication with professionals working with alcoholics</li>
        <li>Finding simple, effective ways of cooperating without affiliating</li>
        <li>Explaining clearly what A.A. does and doesn't do</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>AA Resources for Professionals</h2>
